Rules:
- I AM DEVELOPING IN WINDOWS 10
- I AM USING PYTHON 3.11
- Write to report.md in docs\SOP\changes.md on what was changed and how it was done on major changes to the codebase. 
- Write to tasks.md in docs\SOP\tasks.md on what tasks need to be done once I declare the work is done for the day.

Report Writing:
- Use github markdown formatting. 
- Keep it concise and to the point.
- Use the following format for the report:

```markdown
## [Date] - [Change]

[Description of the change]
```
- If the change is a new feature, include a description of the feature and how it was implemented.
- If the change is a bug fix, include a description of the bug and how it was fixed.
- If the change is a refactoring, include a description of the refactoring and how it was done.
- If the change is a documentation update, include a description of the documentation update and how it was done.

Tasks:
- Use github markdown formatting. 
- Keep it concise and to the point.
- Use the following format for the tasks:

```markdown
- [ ] [Task Description]
```

